  "about": "Skills design-hub knows by name, mapped to stages with a one-line summary in SumitCraft's own words (no text copied from the skills). Unknown skills are classified by keywords at run time. 'role' says how the hub uses it: make (generates or changes the design), judge (reviews it), measure (produces numbers), guide (method/reference). 'not_design' lists skills that use design words for something else (system design, API design) or are video/engineering skills; they are never classified as design skills by keywords.",
